---
import { getLocalizedPath } from '../../../i18n/utils';

import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import toursData from '../../../data/tours.en.json';

const matchingTours = toursData.filter(t => ["rara-lake-bardia", "immersion-spirituelle", "carnet-de-voyage"].includes(t.slug));

const frTargetUrl = getLocalizedPath(Astro.url, 'fr');
const enTargetUrl = getLocalizedPath(Astro.url, 'en');
---

<Layout 
  title="Annapurna & Pokhara | Destinations Jungle Nepal Adventure"
  description="La région de l’Annapurna est l’une des zones de trekking les plus spectaculaires et variées de la planète. Située à courte distance de la charmante vi"
  image="/assets/original_site/nepal_landscape.webp"
  lang="en"
  isDarkHeader={true}
>
  <Header lang="en" currentPath="/en/destinations/annapurna" />

  <!-- HERO BANNER DESTINATION -->
  <div class="relative min-h-[50vh] flex items-center justify-center pt-32 pb-20 px-4 bg-slate-950 text-white overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img src="/assets/original_site/nepal_landscape.webp" alt="Annapurna & Pokhara" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-50 scale-105 filter brightness-80 contrast-105" />
      
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4">
      <nav class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-2">
        <a href="/en/" class="hover:text-white">Home</a>
        <span>›</span>
        <a href="/en/destinations" class="hover:text-white">Destinations</a>
        <span>›</span>
        <span class="text-amber-100 font-bold">Annapurna & Pokhara</span>
      </nav>

      
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
        Annapurna & Pokhara
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-xl text-slate-200 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-medium leading-relaxed drop-shadow">
        Des treks mythiques entre hauts sommets, lacs sacrés et cultures montagnardes
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MAIN CONTAINER (LAYOUT D'ORIGINE AVEC FICHE TECHNIQUE À DROITE) -->
  <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 font-sans space-y-16">
    
    <!-- 1. GRILLE 2 COLONNES : TEXTE COMPLET (GAUCHE) & FICHE TECHNIQUE (DROITE) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
      
      <!-- Colonne Gauche : 100% Contenu Texte Official junglenepal.com -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#0e8354]">Wild Immersion</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-950 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Explore Annapurna & Pokhara
        </h2>
        <div class="text-slate-700 text-base leading-relaxed space-y-4 font-normal">
          <p>The Annapurna massif is one of the most spectacular and diverse trekking regions on Earth. Located a short distance from the charming lakeside city of Pokhara, it allows travelers to journey within a few days from lush subtropical valleys shaded by banana palms to giant rhododendron forests, culminating on high alpine balconies facing iconic Himalayan giants like Machapuchare (the sacred Fish Tail), Dhaulagiri, and Annapurna South.</p>
          <p>Trekking through the Annapurnas is far more than gazing at dizzying peaks—it is fundamentally a warm and uplifting human encounter. Along ancient stone paths, nights are spent in cozy family-run tea houses. Travelers share steaming plates of restorative Dal Bhat beside glowing woodstoves while discovering the generous customs of the Gurung people.</p>
          <p>The two premier seasons to explore the Annapurnas are autumn (October to December), with crystal-clear skies and crisp visibility after the monsoon, and spring (March to May), when entire mountain flanks burst into brilliant shades of red and pink rhododendron blossoms.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Colonne Droite : Fiche Pratique / Fiche Technique du Lieu -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white rounded-3xl p-7 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xl space-y-6 sticky top-28">
        <h3 class="font-black text-xl text-slate-950 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#0e8354]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"></line></svg>
          <span>Practical & Technical Facts</span>
        </h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Best Travel Period</p>
          <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 mt-0.5">October to December (Crystal skies) & March to May (Rhododendron blooms)</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Walking Level</p>
          <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 mt-0.5">4 to 7 hours of daily walking at a steady, accessible pace</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Iconic Viewpoints</p>
          <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 mt-0.5">Poon Hill, Annapurna balconies, sacred Pokhara valley & Lake Phewa</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Accommodation</p>
          <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 mt-0.5">Warm family-run mountain tea houses & comfortable boutique lakeside hotels in Pokhara</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Guiding Team</p>
          <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 mt-0.5">Certified professional naturalist guides and respected, fully insured local porters</p>
        </div>
        </div>

        <a href="https://wa.me/33695413227?text=Bonjour%20Robin%2C%20je%20souhaite%20des%20renseignements%20sur%20Annapurna & Pokhara" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block w-full text-center py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#0e5c3e] hover:bg-[#09422b] text-white font-extrabold text-xs shadow-md shadow-[#0e8354]/30 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-95 transition-all">
          Ask a question about Annapurna & Pokhara →
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- 2. ENCART CULTURE LOCALE & POPULATIONS -->
    <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl bg-safari-100 border border-slate-200 space-y-4">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3">
        <span class="inline-block text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#0e8354] bg-white px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          Sacred Himalaya
        </span>
        <h3 class="font-black text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-slate-950 tracking-tight">
          Gurung Villages & Serenity in Pokhara
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Perched on verdant ridges, the ancient Gurung villages of Ghandruk and Landruk showcase dry-stone slate-roofed homes and terraced fields. In Pokhara, the tranquil shores of Lake Phewa provide the perfect setting to unwind beneath the mirror reflection of Mount Machapuchare.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. GALERIE PHOTO IMMERSIVE (4 PHOTOS HD AVEC LIGHTBOX) -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div>
        <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0e8354]">Field Photography</span>
        <h3 class="font-black text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-slate-950">Visual Overview of Annapurna & Pokhara</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div onclick="openLightbox(0)" class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md h-60 group cursor-pointer relative">
          <img src="/assets/original_site/nepal_landscape.webp" alt="Annapurna & Pokhara" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div onclick="openLightbox(1)" class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md h-60 group cursor-pointer relative">
          <img src="/assets/original_site/fishtail_sacred_himalaya.webp" alt="Annapurna & Pokhara" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div onclick="openLightbox(2)" class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md h-60 group cursor-pointer relative">
          <img src="/assets/original_site/machapuchare.webp" alt="Annapurna & Pokhara" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div onclick="openLightbox(3)" class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md h-60 group cursor-pointer relative">
          <img src="/assets/original_site/himalayas_sunrise_peaks.webp" alt="Annapurna & Pokhara" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4. CIRCUITS ASSOCIÉS À CETTE DESTINATION -->
    <div class="space-y-8 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0e8354]">2026/2027 Season</span>
          <h3 class="font-black text-2xl sm:text-4xl text-slate-950">Immersive Expeditions in Annapurna & Pokhara</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-1">Guaranteed small group departures. Click on any itinerary to view the day-by-day program.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/en/#prochains-departs" class="text-xs font-black text-[#0e8354] hover:underline shrink-0">
          View all 15 Expeditions →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        {matchingTours.map((tour) => (
          <div 
            class="bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col group cursor-pointer"
            onclick={`window.location.href='/en/tours/${tour.slug}'`}
          >
            <!-- Photo Hero -->
            <div class="relative h-60 overflow-hidden bg-slate-900">
              <img 
                src={tour.images[0]} 
                alt={tour.title} 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" 
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
              

              <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 right-4 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md text-amber-100 border border-amber-300/30 text-xs font-black">
                  {tour.badge}
                </span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md text-white text-xs font-bold">
                  4 to 10 travelers
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 text-white">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-slate-200">
                  <span>🕒 {tour.duration}</span>
                  <span>•</span>
                  <span class="text-amber-100">★ {tour.rating} ({tour.reviews} reviews)</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card Body -->
            <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
              <div>
                <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#0e8354]">{tour.style}</span>
                <h3 class="font-black text-xl text-slate-950 mt-1 leading-snug group-hover:text-[#0e8354] transition-colors">
                  {tour.title}
                </h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                  {tour.overview}
                </p>
              </div>

              <!-- Price & CTA -->
              <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                <div>
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase text-slate-400 block">From</span>
                  <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
                    <span class="font-black text-2xl text-slate-950 tracking-tight">{tour.price}</span>
                    {tour.originalPrice && (
                      <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 line-through font-bold">{tour.originalPrice}</span>
                    )}
                  </div>
                </div>

                <a 
                  href={`/en/tours/${tour.slug}`}
                  class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#0e5c3e] hover:bg-[#09422b] text-white font-extrabold text-xs shadow-md shadow-[#0e8354]/30 group-hover:shadow-lg hover:scale-105 transition-all"
                >
                  View Expedition →
                </a>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>

  <Footer lang="en" />

  <!-- LIGHTBOX MODAL -->
  <div id="lightbox-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/95 backdrop-blur-xl z-50 hidden opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="absolute top-6 left-6 right-6 flex items-center justify-between text-white z-10">
      <div id="lightbox-counter" class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold border border-white/20">
        1 / 4
      </div>
      <button onclick="closeLightbox()" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-white transition-all hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 cursor-pointer">
        ✕
      </button>
    </div>

    <button onclick="prevLightboxImage(event)" class="absolute left-4 sm:left-8 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-black/60 hover:bg-black/90 border border-white/20 text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-all hover:scale-110 active:scale-95 z-20 shadow-2xl cursor-pointer">
      ‹
    </button>
    <button onclick="nextLightboxImage(event)" class="absolute right-4 sm:right-8 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-black/60 hover:bg-black/90 border border-white/20 text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-all hover:scale-110 active:scale-95 z-20 shadow-2xl cursor-pointer">
      ›
    </button>

    <div class="relative max-w-5xl max-h-[85vh] flex items-center justify-center">
      <img id="lightbox-image" src="" alt="Enlarged photo" class="max-w-full max-h-[85vh] object-contain rounded-2xl shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    const galleryImages = ["/assets/original_site/nepal_landscape.webp", "/assets/original_site/fishtail_sacred_himalaya.webp", "/assets/original_site/machapuchare.webp", "/assets/original_site/himalayas_sunrise_peaks.webp"];
    let currentImageIndex = 0;

    window.openLightbox = function(index) {
      currentImageIndex = index;
      updateLightboxContent();
      const modal = document.getElementById('lightbox-modal');
      modal.classList.remove('hidden');
      setTimeout(() => {
        modal.classList.remove('opacity-0');
        modal.classList.add('opacity-100');
      }, 10);
      document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
    };

    window.closeLightbox = function() {
      const modal = document.getElementById('lightbox-modal');
      modal.classList.remove('opacity-100');
      modal.classList.add('opacity-0');
      setTimeout(() => {
        modal.classList.add('hidden');
        document.body.style.overflow = '';
      }, 300);
    };

    function updateLightboxContent() {
      const img = document.getElementById('lightbox-image');
      const counter = document.getElementById('lightbox-counter');
      if (img && galleryImages[currentImageIndex]) {
        img.src = galleryImages[currentImageIndex];
      }
      if (counter) {
        counter.textContent = (currentImageIndex + 1) + ' / ' + galleryImages.length;
      }
    }

    window.prevLightboxImage = function(e) {
      if (e) e.stopPropagation();
      currentImageIndex = (currentImageIndex - 1 + galleryImages.length) % galleryImages.length;
      updateLightboxContent();
    };

    window.nextLightboxImage = function(e) {
      if (e) e.stopPropagation();
      currentImageIndex = (currentImageIndex + 1) % galleryImages.length;
      updateLightboxContent();
    };

    document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
      const modal = document.getElementById('lightbox-modal');
      if (modal && !modal.classList.contains('hidden')) {
        if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') window.prevLightboxImage();
        if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') window.nextLightboxImage();
        if (e.key === 'Escape') window.closeLightbox();
      }
    });
  </script>
  <!-- MODAL AGRÉMENTS LÉGAUX ET LICENCES OFFICIELLES DU NÉPAL -->
  <div id="legal-modal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-950/85 backdrop-blur-md p-4 transition-opacity duration-300">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 max-w-lg w-full shadow-2xl border border-slate-200 text-slate-900 relative max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
      <button onclick="closeLegalModal()" class="absolute top-4 right-4 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 font-bold transition-colors cursor-pointer">✕</button>
      
      <div class="text-center space-y-2 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100">
        
        <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#0e8354] bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-200">Government of Nepal</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-950 tracking-tight">Jungle Nepal Adventure Pvt. Ltd.</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">Officially registered and licensed ecotourism & expedition company in Nepal</p>
      </div>

      <div class="py-5 space-y-3.5 text-xs text-slate-700">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase text-[10px]">Certificate of Incorporation</span>
            <span class="font-black text-[#0e8354] bg-emerald-100/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px]">Official</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-900 font-black text-sm">Office of the Company Registrar, Nepal</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">Registration No.: 384414/82/83</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Pursuant to Sub-Section (1) of Section 5 of the Companies Act, 2006 of Nepal.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase text-[10px]">Tax & VAT Registration</span>
            <span class="font-black text-[#0e8354] bg-emerald-100/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px]">Verified</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-900 font-black text-sm">Inland Revenue Department of Nepal</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">PAN Tax ID: 623537310</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Jurisdiction: Inland Revenue Office Nepalgunj.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-2">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase text-[10px] block">Registered Office & Operations</span>
          <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs">Thakurdwara Ward No. 9, Thakurbaba Municipality, Bardia District, Lumbini Province, Nepal</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Founder & Director: Pawan Kumar Thapa (Native Bardia Master Tracker)</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 text-slate-800 space-y-1.5 font-medium">
          <p class="font-bold text-[#0e8354] text-xs">State-Licensed Operating Activities:</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Licensed organization of wildlife safaris, walking tracking of Bengal tigers, wild river expeditions (Karnali Rafting), wilderness bush camps, and certified ecotourism.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-2">
        <button onclick="closeLegalModal()" class="w-full py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold text-xs transition-colors cursor-pointer">
          Close Legal Notice
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
  function openLegalModal() {
    const m = document.getElementById('legal-modal');
    if (m) m.classList.remove('hidden');
  }
  function closeLegalModal() {
    const m = document.getElementById('legal-modal');
    if (m) m.classList.add('hidden');
  }
  </script>
</Layout>
